	<string name="use_microphone_audio">Use Microphone Input</string>
	<string name="use_microphone_audio_summary">For the audioSpectrum uniform, listen to the microphone. Used as a fallback whenever system playback audio is on but not yet available; turn this off to stay silent instead.</string>
	<string name="use_system_audio">Use System Playback Audio</string>
	<string name="use_system_audio_summary">For the audioSpectrum uniform, also try to analyze what the device is playing back. Only works while running a shader in the app (falls back to the microphone, if enabled, for the live wallpaper and manual preview). When asked, choose \"Entire screen\", not \"A single app\" (picking an app switches you to it instead of capturing its audio). If you cancel the prompt, turn this off and back on to ask again.</string>
	<string name="audio_spectrum_shadertoy_compatible">ShaderToy-Compatible Audio Timing</string>
	<string name="audio_spectrum_shadertoy_compatible_summary">For the audioSpectrum uniform. Off (default): analyze the full time since the previous frame, resized down to 512 bins - smoother, less jumpy. On: use ShaderToy\'s short, fixed-size audio window instead, for exact compatibility with ShaderToy audio shaders.</string>
